# LCOS 1.1 UEFI picker. lcos-bootmenu (seeded) depends on refind and
# calls efibootmgr. Listed here so the ISO has them even before the
# seeded deb is unpacked. The apt snippet 90lcos-refind-no-esp keeps
# refind's postinst from installing itself onto the ESP.
refind
